            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Stanley... Stanley..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1011302",
      "subQuestName": "Sit behind Stanley",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101130201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101130201": {
            "id": "101130201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "You know, I'm glad I actually had the chance to come down here today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130202"
            ]
          },
          "101130202": {
            "id": "101130202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "The tavern isn't overcrowded, and I couldn't be in a better mood."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1011303",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101130301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101130301": {
            "id": "101130301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Tell me, Stanley... Tell me what should I do...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130302"
            ]
          },
          "101130302": {
            "id": "101130302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Why does he keep repeating his own name?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130304",
              "101130306"
            ]
          },
          "101130304": {
            "id": "101130304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Could there be another person called Stanley?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130307"
            ]
          },
          "101130307": {
            "id": "101130307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "*sobs* Oh, Stanley...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130308"
            ]
          },
          "101130308": {
            "id": "101130308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "It should have been me! I should have been the one to die in the Mare Jivari that day... Why won't your spirit come and stop me from using your name? Why, Stanley, why?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130309"
            ]
          },
          "101130309": {
            "id": "101130309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "If only you hadn't had to save a rookie like me, you would have never died in that windless corner of the world...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130310"
            ]
          },
          "101130310": {
            "id": "101130310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "You were a renowned adventurer, destined to become a legend one day... But now... that'll never happen, because your life was cut short— and all because of a worthless tag-along...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130311"
            ]
          },
          "101130311": {
            "id": "101130311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh... Does anyone get what's going on here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130312"
            ]
          },
          "101130312": {
            "id": "101130312",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "...I think our friend really did make it to the Mare Jivari. And I think the tragedy he encountered there was real, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130313"
            ]
          },
          "101130313": {
            "id": "101130313",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "But the real adventurer, the real Stanley — that was his partner. Not him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130314"
            ]
          },
          "101130314": {
            "id": "101130314",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "The real Stanley is the one who died to save our \"Stanley.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130315"
            ]
          },
          "101130315": {
            "id": "101130315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait... So the only reason our Stanley is called Stanley in the first place is because he stole the other Stanley's name?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130316"
            ]
          },
          "101130316": {
            "id": "101130316",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "I fear that may be the case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130317"
            ]
          },
          "101130317": {
            "id": "101130317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Stanley, for so many years I've lived in fear... fear that Mondstadt will forget all about you... So I tell your adventure stories at every opportunity...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130318"
            ]
          },
          "101130318": {
            "id": "101130318",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Mondstadt must remember: Stanley reached the center of the Mare Jivari... He's the greatest adventurer there ever was, and he lives on!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130319"
            ]
          },
          "101130319": {
            "id": "101130319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Stanley will never die, because... I am Stanley! I... am Stanley...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130320"
            ]
          },
          "101130320": {
            "id": "101130320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "I'm sorry, Stanley... I'm getting too old... now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130321"
            ]
          },
          "101130321": {
            "id": "101130321",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "*sigh* ...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130322"
            ]
          },
          "101130322": {
            "id": "101130322",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Are you guys planning on eavesdropping much longer?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130323"
            ]
          },
          "101130323": {
            "id": "101130323",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yikes! We're busted!"
          },
          "101130306": {
            "id": "101130306",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Surely not. Even I've never heard tell of a second Stanley."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1011304",
      "subQuestName": "Try to make conversation with Stanley",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101130401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101130401": {
            "id": "101130401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "*sigh* Go away. Save your questions, just... leave me in peace.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130402"
            ]
          },
          "101130402": {
            "id": "101130402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130403"
            ]
          },
          "101130403": {
            "id": "101130403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Leave, now! Don't make me tell you again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130404"
            ]
          },
          "101130404": {
            "id": "101130404",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Honorary Knight! Venti! And Paimon! I'm so glad you guys are here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130405"
            ]
          },
          "101130405": {
            "id": "101130405",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "I've been looking for you everywhere! I wanted to thank you again for helping me find the sword and shield. My parents are finally supporting me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130406"
            ]
          },
          "101130406": {
            "id": "101130406",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Oh... Really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130407"
            ]
          },
          "101130407": {
            "id": "101130407",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Yeah, really! They even said they're gonna pay for someone to fix up the Sword of Brilliant Valor and Shield of Magnificent Honor for me, so I can take them out on the road.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130408"
            ]
          },
          "101130408": {
            "id": "101130408",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "That's wonderful! So, Jack, is this the part where you bid farewell to Mondstadt and set off on your intrepid trip traversing Teyvat?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130409"
            ]
          },
          "101130409": {
            "id": "101130409",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "No, not yet. I still don't have what it takes to go too far from home just yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130410"
            ]
          },
          "101130410": {
            "id": "101130410",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Besides, I'm sure Stanley still has a few stories left to tell. Hehe... They're what inspired me to become an adventurer in the first place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130411"
            ]
          },
          "101130411": {
            "id": "101130411",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "Stanley, I— Oh, you're drunk again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130412"
            ]
          },
          "101130412": {
            "id": "101130412",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Jack",
            "text": "See you tomorrow, then. After your hangover wears off, maybe you can tell me some more of your stories?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130413"
            ]
          },
          "101130413": {
            "id": "101130413",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Stanley's really fond of that kid, don't you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130414"
            ]
          },
          "101130414": {
            "id": "101130414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "*hic* Jack? Jack!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130415"
            ]
          },
          "101130415": {
            "id": "101130415",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Jack left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130416"
            ]
          },
          "101130416": {
            "id": "101130416",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Oh, I see... Well, thank you for not telling him about my secret.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130417"
            ]
          },
          "101130417": {
            "id": "101130417",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Eh? All of a sudden you're facing the facts? That isn't like you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130418"
            ]
          },
          "101130418": {
            "id": "101130418",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Just now... I couldn't bear to look at him. His adventurer's spirit is so pure... unblemished...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130419"
            ]
          },
          "101130419": {
            "id": "101130419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "I'm just a weary old feckless fraud, but that kid is a brand-new shining star, full of potential... I cannot allow his dreams to be crushed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130421"
            ]
          },
          "101130421": {
            "id": "101130421",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Stories... Experiences... What's the point of them anymore?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130423"
            ]
          },
          "101130423": {
            "id": "101130423",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "That's my biggest secret of all. And my biggest fear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130425"
            ]
          },
          "101130425": {
            "id": "101130425",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "But the one thing I can never forget... is that he died in a windless land, where his spirit can never be recovered!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130428"
            ]
          },
          "101130428": {
            "id": "101130428",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Exactly... Even in his memory, the real Stanley isn't the living, breathing friend he knew at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130429"
            ]
          },
          "101130429": {
            "id": "101130429",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Instead, he's become fixed on the image of him as that battle-scarred warrior... and that image has held him captive his entire life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130430"
            ]
          },
          "101130430": {
            "id": "101130430",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "I'm too old... I never let go, but still so much has slipped away...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130431"
            ]
          },
          "101130431": {
            "id": "101130431",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "I'm completely and utterly worthless!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130432"
            ]
          },
          "101130432": {
            "id": "101130432",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "No adventurer should have to go that way... No adventurer ever...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130433"
            ]
          },
          "101130433": {
            "id": "101130433",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "I... I can't believe it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130434"
            ]
          },
          "101130434": {
            "id": "101130434",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "Thank you all! And thank you, Lord Barbatos...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130435"
            ]
          },
          "101130435": {
            "id": "101130435",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "I'm sorry, it's gonna take me some time to calm back down...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130436"
            ]
          },
          "101130436": {
            "id": "101130436",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Stanley",
            "text": "But, I think that... I'm gonna be okay...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130437"
            ]
          },
          "101130437": {
            "id": "101130437",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Ah, wonderful! Stanley reconnected with his true self, and Jack can finally go his own way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130438"
            ]
          },
          "101130438": {
            "id": "101130438",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "This calls for a celebration! And by celebration, I do of course mean libation!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130439"
            ]
          },
          "101130439": {
            "id": "101130439",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And by libation, you mean you're not leaving this tavern till you're too drunk to walk, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130440"
            ]
          },
          "101130440": {
            "id": "101130440",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Haha... no. The wine here's too expensive. Jack still owes me some wine though — he promised me a rare vintage in exchange for helping him out, remember?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130441"
            ]
          },
          "101130441": {
            "id": "101130441",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "I'll head off to fetch the wine. See you shortly! Let's meet at the <color=#00E1FFFF>usual place</color>.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130442"
            ]
          },
          "101130442": {
            "id": "101130442",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Where's that supposed to be? Why has Paimon never heard of it? Hey, Tone-Deaf Bard!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1011305",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the \"usual place\"",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101130501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101130501": {
            "id": "101130501",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "You made it... finally.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130502"
            ]
          },
          "101130502": {
            "id": "101130502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Just tell us where you mean next time, okay!? We looked everywhere!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130503"
            ]
          },
          "101130503": {
            "id": "101130503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmph... So. Did you at least manage to find your wine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130504"
            ]
          },
          "101130504": {
            "id": "101130504",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Yep! Well, sort of... Jack made it out to be a rare, collectors' edition vintage...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130505"
            ]
          },
          "101130505": {
            "id": "101130505",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "...when actually, it's just a half bottle of regular cider.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130506"
            ]
          },
          "101130506": {
            "id": "101130506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Ah, this takes me back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130507"
            ]
          },
          "101130507": {
            "id": "101130507",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "The first time I saw this view, I hadn't even taken on this form yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130508"
            ]
          },
          "101130508": {
            "id": "101130508",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...What?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130509"
            ]
          },
          "101130509": {
            "id": "101130509",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "It was about twenty-six hundred years ago, before the world had come under the rule of The Seven.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130510"
            ]
          },
          "101130510": {
            "id": "101130510",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "At that time, Old Mondstadt was ruled by a tyrant, who sealed off the city's perimeter with a ferocious hurricane. Even the birds couldn't get in or out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130511"
            ]
          },
          "101130511": {
            "id": "101130511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Old Mondstadt? Oh, Paimon remembers — nowadays it's known as Stormterror's Lair, right? You mentioned it before!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130512"
            ]
          },
          "101130512": {
            "id": "101130512",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "That's right. The tyrant of the winds who once ruled from that tower was Decarabian, God of Storms.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130513"
            ]
          },
          "101130513": {
            "id": "101130513",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Back then, I was but a wisp among the thousand winds. I wasn't a god of anything — I didn't even have a human form...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130514"
            ]
          },
          "101130514": {
            "id": "101130514",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "I was just a tiny elemental being who lived in the wind, a gentle breeze bringing subtle changes for the better, or tiny seeds of hope.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130515"
            ]
          },
          "101130515": {
            "id": "101130515",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A tiny elemental being? Without a human form? Venti... do you mean you used to look different than you do now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130516"
            ]
          },
          "101130516": {
            "id": "101130516",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Yep. My current form is not so different from the situation with fake Stanley... I took the form of a friend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130517"
            ]
          },
          "101130517": {
            "id": "101130517",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So then what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130518"
            ]
          },
          "101130518": {
            "id": "101130518",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What happened to your friend?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130519"
            ]
          },
          "101130519": {
            "id": "101130519",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Same situation as with Stanley's friend...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130520"
            ]
          },
          "101130520": {
            "id": "101130520",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Say, Paimon, do you wish to hear the next part of the story?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130521"
            ]
          },
          "101130521": {
            "id": "101130521",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes, of course! The suspense is killing Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130523",
              "101130525"
            ]
          },
          "101130523": {
            "id": "101130523",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now's the time you suddenly get a craving for apples? Really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130526"
            ]
          },
          "101130526": {
            "id": "101130526",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Hahaha, getting a little... peckish or something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130527"
            ]
          },
          "101130527": {
            "id": "101130527",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Oh, so peckish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130528"
            ]
          },
          "101130528": {
            "id": "101130528",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh! Paimon's had it up to here with you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130529"
            ]
          },
          "101130529": {
            "id": "101130529",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Ah... You know, you're so smart it almost makes me uncomfortable sometimes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130530"
            ]
          },
          "101130530": {
            "id": "101130530",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "But then, maybe it's right that true friends can tell what the other is thinking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130531"
            ]
          },
          "101130531": {
            "id": "101130531",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "A refreshing drink, a gentle breeze... *sigh* Moments like this always take me back...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130532"
            ]
          },
          "101130532": {
            "id": "101130532",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Back to a song that I first heard from him...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101130533"
            ]
          },
          "101130533": {
            "id": "101130533",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm listening."
          },
          "101130525": {
            "id": "101130525",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But Venti's telling his story! What makes you suddenly wanna have a meat feast!?"
          }
        }
      }
